{
  "_doc": "Free starter dress-up KITS for Corpan City onboarding (R2-6 Pair Identity). Each kit is the cosmetic palette a fresh Track of a given target is born able to wear (CosmeticItem[] — contracts/src/identity.ts). `kit-traveler` is the UNIVERSAL DEFAULT (the original starter set); the runtime falls back to it for any unknown kit id. Per-theme kits (kit-market, kit-tokyo, …) keep the SAME slots + item ids and only swap the display name + tint swatches to the world era, so the dress-up UI + the characterSpec mapping are UNCHANGED — it is a palette swap, never a paywall. All items remain unlock.kind=xp value=0 (free from the start). `tints` is an extra, non-contract field (ignored by the CosmeticItem schema) listing the colour swatches the dress-up offers. Slots: top, hat, accessory. Wholesome + dignified only. Every kit item is validated against the CosmeticItem contract at load.",
